# Chep file nay thanh  .env  roi dien vao. File .env DA nam trong .gitignore.
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# Co HAI cach, chon mot:
#
#   A. Tai khoan  - script tu goi POST /auth/login lay token moi lan chay.
#                   Chay duoc mot lenh duy nhat, khong phai dan gi.
#   B. Token san  - dan JWT vao <APP>_JWT. Khong luu mat khau xuong dia,
#                   nhung token song ~6h-1 ngay nen phai dan lai thuong xuyen.
#
# Neu dien ca hai thi <APP>_JWT duoc uu tien.
# Bien moi truong that (export/set) luon thang gia tri trong file nay.

# ─── Ralli / CTDA  (https://ralliai.rangdong.com.vn:9001) ───
RALLI_USER=
RALLI_PASS=
# RALLI_JWT=

# ─── TLA Hop Dong  (https://chatbothd.rangdong.com.vn:10001) ───
HD_USER=
HD_PASS=
# HD_JWT=

# ─── Khoa doc API cua dashboard  (backend/main.py) ───
# BAT BUOC. Thieu bien nay thi may chu TU CHOI KHOI DONG - do la chu y, khong
# phai loi: che do hong phai la "khong chay", tuyet doi khong phai "chay mo".
#
# Sinh mot khoa:
#     python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"
#
# Dan ket qua vao dong duoi. Nguoi xem dashboard nhap dung chuoi nay mot lan,
# trinh duyet nho lai. Doi khoa la moi nguoi phai nhap lai.
DASHBOARD_KEY=

# Chi khi PHAT TRIEN. Bo qua xac thuc, may chu in canh bao moi lan khoi dong.
# Dat bien nay tren may co the ra mang = mo lai dung lo hong da bit.
# DASHBOARD_OPEN=1

# Origin duoc phep goi API (CORS). De trong la dung mac dinh:
# null (file://) + 127.0.0.1:8080 + localhost:8080
# DASHBOARD_ORIGINS=http://127.0.0.1:8080

# ─── PostgreSQL cuc bo (docker-compose.yml) ───
# De trong la dung mac dinh duoi day. Chi mo tren 127.0.0.1 nen khong ra mang.
# Doi thi phai `docker compose down -v` roi `up -d` lai, vi mat khau chi duoc
# dat luc container khoi tao lan dau.
# PGDATABASE=token_ledger_v2
# PGUSER=token
# PGPASSWORD=token_local
# PGPORT=5432
# PGHOST=127.0.0.1
# PGADMIN_EMAIL=admin@example.com   (phai co duoi mien, 'admin@local' bi tu choi)
# PGADMIN_PASSWORD=admin_local
# PGADMIN_PORT=5050

# ─── API Gateway (docker compose --profile gateway) ───
# Ba bien duoi day KHONG co gia tri mac dinh. Thieu bat ky bien nao thi container
# LiteLLM DUNG HAN ngay khi khoi dong - khong bao gio chay o che do mo.

# Master key cua LiteLLM. Phai bat dau bang 'sk-'. Sinh mot khoa:
#     python -c "import secrets; print('sk-' + secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"
LITELLM_MASTER_KEY=

# Khoa ma hoa cac Virtual Key luu trong database. DOI KHOA NAY = moi Virtual Key
# da cap deu doc khong ra nua. Sinh mot lan roi giu nguyen:
#     python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"
LITELLM_SALT_KEY=

# Khoa nha cung cap. Da co san trong .env cua may nay.
# KEY_GOOGLE_AI_STU=

# Khoa nha cung cap cua agent Phan Loai Du Lieu CRM (`crm-feedback`, agent 7), tuyen
# `gemini-2.5-flash` dung. BAT BUOC khi bat profile `gateway`: thieu no thi
# docker/gateway/entrypoint.sh dung han truoc khi LiteLLM khoi dong. Che do hong phai
# la "khong chay", khong phai "chay ma tuyen chet".
#
# Day la khoa VERTEX EXPRESS, khong phai Google AI Studio. Do 10/09/2026 va do lai
# 17/09/2026: tien to `AQ.`, 53 ky tu. Dung loai ma tuyen nay can.
#
# TEN BIEN DOI 17/09/2026:  KEY_BENCH_CRM_TEST_GG_AIA_STU -> KEY_CRM_FEEDBACK
# Ten cu noi sai ba lan: khoa nay khong phai `BENCH`, khong phai `TEST`, va khong
# phai AI Studio (`GG_AIA_STU`). No la khoa production cua agent 7. Ten moi lay tu
# `dim_agent.code`, la CUNG chuoi dang lam nhan tren tuyen: tags: ["crm-feedback"].
# KEY_CRM_FEEDBACK=

# Cong va mat khau ha tang Gateway. De trong la dung mac dinh, chap nhan duoc vi
# tat ca deu chi mo tren 127.0.0.1.
# REDIS_PASSWORD=redis_local
# REDIS_PORT=6379
# Nginx noi bo de ban giao cho reverse proxy/TLS tren may chu.
LLM_GATEWAY_DOMAIN=apigateway.rangdong.com.vn
# Giu 127.0.0.1 neu reverse proxy/TLS chay tren cung may. Neu proxy o may khac,
# dat IP LAN cua VM va gioi han firewall chi cho phep may proxy truy cap.
LLM_GATEWAY_EDGE_BIND=127.0.0.1
LLM_GATEWAY_EDGE_PORT=8088
# Status UI has no login. Allow only a verified admin source IP/CIDR (TCP peer).
# Docker may NAT local requests: verify peer before changing this, never allow all.
LLM_GATEWAY_ADMIN_CIDR=127.0.0.1/32
# Separate allowlist for LAN peers permitted to view the web/status UI. Keep it
# a real subnet, never 0.0.0.0/0 -- there is no login on that page. Chat
# completions endpoints are unaffected by this; they only check the API key.
LLM_GATEWAY_LAN_CIDR=127.0.0.1/32
# Compatibility: EDGE_BIND/PORT now publish gateway-lb; LiteLLM stays private.

# gateway-lb also terminates HTTPS on its own (real cert, see
# docker/gateway/tls/README.md for provisioning/renewal), in parallel with the
# plain HTTP port above -- it does not replace it. Same loopback-by-default
# convention as EDGE_BIND.
LLM_GATEWAY_TLS_BIND=127.0.0.1
LLM_GATEWAY_TLS_PORT=443

# --- gateway-watch: canh Gateway roi gui thu khi trang thai doi -----------------
# `gateway-status` DO nhung khong bao; dich vu nay bien trang do thanh thu.
#
# Ten cua ban nay, di vao tieu de thu. Chay them mot ban tren may khac thi dat ten
# khac (vi du `ngoai`) -- nhan thu tu ban nao la biet hong o lop nao.
# WATCH_NAME=trong
# Nhip do. De 60 chu khong phai 300: phep do mien phi nen cua so mu la thu ta TU
# CHON, ma agent thi bo ca lo sau 21-24 giay.
# WATCH_EVERY_SECONDS=60
# Phai LON HON han ket noi cua Gateway: nginx.conf khai proxy_connect_timeout 10s va
# proxy_next_upstream_tries 2, tuc mot request co the mat toi 20 giay moi ra ket qua dung.
# De 10 giay thi mot instance chet bi bao thanh `unavailable` thay vi `degraded` (do 17/09).
# WATCH_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=25
# So nhip hong LIEN TIEP moi bao. 1 la bao ca khi mang trot lot mot nhip.
# WATCH_FAILS_BEFORE=2
# Gio gui thu nhip tim (gio VN). Luat la "lan do dau tien cua ngay SAU gio nay",
# khong phai "dung gio nay" -- dung gio thi container dung lai trung gio se mat thu
# ca ngay, ma vang nhip tim lai la tin hieu "cho canh da chet".
# Dat `off` de TAT han thu nhip tim -- chi con thu khi trang thai doi. Cai gia:
# cho canh chet lang le thi khong con tin hieu nao, vi im lang trong y het "binh
# thuong". Chon 18/09/2026, xem muc 3 docs/reference/canh-gateway-va-gui-thu-17-09.md
# WATCH_HEARTBEAT_HOUR=8
#
# MOI DICH DO DOC TU DAY, khong ghim trong ma. Dang `ten=url`, cach nhau bang
# khoang trang. `WATCH_EXPECT` bat than tra loi phai chua chuoi ay -- 200 chua chac
# la dung, `/health/readiness` co the tra 200 ma `db` khong noi duoc.
# WATCH_HTTP=lb=http://gateway-lb:4000/health/readiness
# WATCH_EXPECT=lb=connected
# WATCH_STATUS_URL=http://gateway-status:8089/api/status
#
# CHUA BAT dich qua ten mien public. Do 17/09/2026: apigateway.rangdong.com.vn tra
# `Non-existent domain`, va khong agent nao dung no -- ca CRM lan DMS deu goi
# http://gateway-lb:4000. Bat bay gio la tu tao mot dich DO MOI PHUT.
# Bat khi ten mien da dung xong, bang cach them mot muc vao WATCH_HTTP:
#   WATCH_HTTP=lb=http://gateway-lb:4000/health/readiness public=https://apigateway.rangdong.com.vn/lb-health
#   WATCH_EXPECT=lb=connected public=lb-ok
#
# Ban chay tren MAY KHAC thi bo WATCH_STATUS_URL di (mang bridge cua Docker la
# scope=local, may khac khong vao duoc) va chi giu dich qua ten mien:
#   WATCH_NAME=ngoai
#   WATCH_HTTP=public=https://apigateway.rangdong.com.vn/lb-health
#   WATCH_STATUS_URL=
#
# Thu tin: tai khoan gui RIENG, khong phai hop thu ca nhan. Day la bi mat DUY NHAT
# ma gateway-watch giu -- no khong cam khoa nha cung cap, master key hay DSN nao.
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USE_TLS=1
# SMTP_USERNAME=canh-gateway@example.com
# SMTP_PASSWORD=
# SMTP_FROM=canh-gateway@example.com
# SMTP_TO=nguoi-van-hanh@example.com

# Database rieng cua Gateway, nam tren CHINH may token-ledger-postgres.
# Khong duoc tro vao database so (token_ledger_v2): phep kiem nghiem thu doi
# database so co DUNG 0 bang ten LiteLLM_*.
# GATEWAY_PGDATABASE=litellm
# GATEWAY_PGUSER=llmproxy
# GATEWAY_PGPASSWORD=llmproxy_local

# Image LiteLLM cua Gateway (va cua litellm-bench). De trong la dung nhan ghim trong
# docker-compose.yml: image CI da dong goi tu nhanh Tuan-develop cua fork, keo tu GHCR,
# khong can dang nhap, khong can thu muc fork ben canh.
# Chi dat bien nay khi muon thu mot ban fork dang sua tren may:
#     docker build -t litellm-local ../litellm_tuan_test
#     LITELLM_IMAGE=litellm-local
# Quay lui ve image build tay cu (neu con tren may): LITELLM_IMAGE=litellm_tuan_test:gateway
# LITELLM_IMAGE=

# --- Dia chi mo dashboard ra ngoai -------------------------------------------
# Dia chi ma dich vu `web` bind vao tren MAY CHU CUA BAN. Chi doi thu nay, con
# lai docker-compose.yml dung chung cho moi may.
#
#   de trong          127.0.0.1  -- may dev, chi chinh may do vao duoc
#   192.168.20.111               -- may chu, ca mang noi bo vao duoc
#   0.0.0.0                      -- moi giao dien; tra loi truoc: ai cham
#                                   toi duoc may nay
#
# PHAI LA IP MA MAY NAY CO THAT. Dat mot IP la thi `web` khong bind duoc va
# `docker compose up` THOAT GIUA CHUNG, keo theo ca cac dich vu phia sau.
#
# Truoc 13/09/2026 dia chi nay ghi cung trong docker-compose.yml nen phai sua
# tay moi lan doi may -- va da quen mot lan. Bien nay de khong con phai nho.
# WEB_BIND=192.168.20.111

# `web` cung tu ket thuc HTTPS (them 18/09/2026, cung cert wildcard voi
# gateway-lb, xem docker/gateway/tls/README.md), song song voi HTTP o tren.
# Dung chung WEB_BIND. Cong host mac dinh 8443 (KHONG phai 443 -- gateway-lb
# da chiem 0.0.0.0:443 qua LLM_GATEWAY_TLS_PORT, trung se EADDRINUSE).
# WEB_TLS_PORT=8443

# --- Log --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Muc chi tiet log cua moi tien trinh chay trong container.
#
#   DEBUG    day du - moi thong bao chi tiet, dung khi di tim nguyen nhan
#   INFO     mac dinh - tien do tung buoc, canh bao, loi, VA MOI DONG SO DO
#   WARNING  im - chi con canh bao va loi
#
# Bien nay TU CHAY XUONG tien trinh con (subprocess ke thua os.environ), nen dat
# mot lan la ca ba tang pipeline deu nghe. Doi cho MOT lan chay ma khong sua file:
#   docker compose --profile tools run -e LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG tools
LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# --- Lam moi so Gateway -----------------------------------------------------
# Nhip cua dich vu `ledger-refresh` (profile "refresh"), don vi GIAY.
#
# Mac dinh 300 tu 12/09/2026. Truoc do la 120.
#
# Can cu cu (09/09): mot chu ky mat 2.348 ms tren 444 dong so nguon, tuc 2% cua
# 120 giay. Ngan hon khong mua them gi -- bang tong hop min nhat la THEO NGAY.
#
# Can cu MOI (do 12/09, 505 dong so nguon):
#
#     nap so Gateway        356 ms   di theo SO DONG MOI
#     tong hop theo ngay    617 ms   XOA HET roi dung lai -> di theo TONG du lieu
#     tong hop theo gio     696 ms   XOA HET roi dung lai -> di theo TONG du lieu
#     phan vi Gateway       157 ms
#     mot luot            1.882 ms
#
# Va day moi la con so quyet dinh: so Gateway trai 314 gio nhung chi 30 gio CO
# luot goi. Voi nhip 120 giay thi 9.420 vong chay cho nhieu nhat 505 dong moi --
# khoang 94% so vong dang xoa roi dung lai hai bang cho dung bang cai vua xoa.
#
# Nen 300 giay: tai giam 2,5 lan, do tre thanh 5 phut. Voi mot dashboard theo doi
# CHI PHI thi 5 phut khong doi quyet dinh nao -- cai dang gia la thay agent chay
# loan trong vai phut, khong phai trong vai giay.
#
# KHONG chon cron nua dem thay cho vong lap: no doi do tuoi 5 phut lay do tre toi
# 24 gio, va no khong re hon that -- van phai dung lai dung hai bang do, chi la
# don vao mot luc.
#
# NGUONG cua phep kiem do tre tu theo: dich vu GHI nhip that cua no vao
# `ref_load_run.every_seconds`, va ca scripts/audit_db.py lan /api/health deu doc
# nhip tu do chu khong doc bien nay. Nen doi o day la du, khong phai sua cho khac.
#   docker compose --profile refresh up -d
REFRESH_EVERY_SECONDS=300
